                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝔢
                      %mn 8
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{e}_8
            may be continued to the Kac-Moody algebras:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/affine+Lie+algebra"}> affine
                \:
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E9"} E9
            %li
              %p
                hyperbolic:
                = succeed "," do
