          %h3#in_supergravity In supergravity
          %p
            The following references discuss aspects of the Kac-Moody
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+geometry"} exceptional geometry
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
